  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A measurable consolidation of policymaking authority (greater single-party or executive control) reduces the range of plausible legislative outcomes on tech and trade, narrowing market disagreement and lowering policy-uncertainty indices over the medium term.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_political_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
