  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising US expectations of stricter AI regulation prompt federal agencies and regulatory counterparts abroad to accelerate inspections, enforcement actions, and rule‑making focused on AI firms and platforms.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
