  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising US expectations for tighter sanctions or export restrictions affecting Iranian (or allied) oil supplies prompt traders to price in reduced future supply, driving up global energy commodity prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
