  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger market expectations of imminent US sanctions or tighter regulatory restrictions cause international banks and asset managers to pre-emptively de-risk exposures to Russia and neighboring markets, generating net capital outflows from the region.</data>
