  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising policy uncertainty tied to Iran-Gulf instability (e.g., unclear sanctions regimes, unpredictable trade restrictions) raises risk premia and expected tail risks for firms exposed to the region, causing US investors to trim exposure to riskier assets and lower overall risk appetite.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
