  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">A sharp Iran-Gulf driven rise in oil and gas prices triggers immediate investor reweighting from rate-sensitive/high-growth assets (notably China tech) into energy producers, commodities and safe‑haven assets, accelerating observed portfolio reallocation flows between regions and asset classes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
</edge>
