  <data key="d37">Spikes in oil and gas prices driven by Gulf disruptions raise inflation and recession concerns and increase market volatility, prompting investors to reallocate from higher-risk assets into safer instruments and thereby reducing aggregate investor risk appetite.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
