  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher perceived risk of oil supply disruptions raises macroeconomic volatility and commodity risk, which directly increases required risk premia across equities and project finance—including premia demanded for AI investments and corporate financing.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
