  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened perceived risk of Russian oil production or export disruptions immediately tightens global crude and refined-product forward curves, pushing up spot and futures energy prices that set regional Gulf market levels.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
