  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">A market revision toward expectations of more aggressive AI-enabled military postures by major powers makes governments likelier to alter sanctions, arms flows and diplomatic support related to the Russia‑Ukraine war, increasing perceived policy uncertainty about future public‑policy directions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
