  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">A rapid upward revision in expected interventionist AI and tech policies (e.g., industrial subsidies, export controls) increases conflicting public signals and hedging activity, which directly raises market-measured policy uncertainty (news/option/survey indexes) within weeks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
