  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Improved global investor sentiment following a perceptible AI power shift prompts portfolio reallocation into risk assets, generating net inflows into global and regional equity markets including Gulf and Iran-exposed equities.</data>
