  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A pronounced rise in investor sentiment favoring AI‑leading economies reallocates portfolio and direct investment toward those markets and away from conflict‑adjacent or higher‑risk assets, reducing net cross‑border capital inflows into Russia/Ukraine exposures.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
