  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising perceptions of regulatory intervention in AI among major powers cause Gulf governments and market participants to reassess likely trade, sanctions and tech-policy paths, thereby increasing market-perceived policy uncertainty in the region.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
