  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising perceived regulatory risk for AI/tech firms (higher likelihood/severity of intervention) triggers systematic mandate and risk‑management-driven selling of exposed equities and reallocations into other sectors/regions, increasing net portfolio reallocation flows.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_power_shift</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_tech_rivalry</data>
