  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A visible shift in global AI leadership prompts sustained calls for stricter AI oversight, driving congressional committees to pass binding oversight mandates and appropriation riders that materially increase legislative authority relative to the executive.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_ai_power_shift</data>
